    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d840">

                <pb facs="0912" n="792" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg792"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Russian Ambassador to the Acting Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Russian Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Magnolia,
                                Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-07-26"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 26,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am directed by cable to request permission to return to Russia, under promise
                    not to take part in the war, for Sublieutenant Bertenson, of the cruiser <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Aurora</hi>. Admiral Enquist is under orders to submit
                    this request to the local authorities at Manila. Your kind cooperation would be
                    highly appreciated. Sublieutenant Bertenson is a son of the celebrated Doctor
                    Bertenson, physician to His Majesty the Emperor. Another son of his was killed
                    in the battle of Tsu Shima.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rosen.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
